    'faq.cat.beginner': 'Getting Started',
    'faq.q.1': 'What is fictional world creation? Where should I start as a newcomer?',
    'faq.a.1': 'Fictional world creation is designing completely fictional worlds on M.NationWorld — micronations, sci-fi and fantasy are all welcome. You can design a flag, a constitution, a worldview and history, and build a world of your own. For first-time use, we recommend this order: sign up and complete your identity setup → build your world in the Creation section → write your first encyclopedia article with the FluidCanvas editor → interact with other creators in the Community Hub. See the "Quick Start" section at the top of this page for details.',
    'faq.q.2': 'Which languages does the platform support?',
    'faq.a.2': 'The platform currently uses Simplified Chinese as its primary language, and the multilingual system is being rolled out gradually; once a new language is available, you can select the interface language in Settings and switch without any other steps.',
    'faq.cat.account': 'Account & Data',
    'faq.q.3': 'How long is my data kept after I log out?',
    'faq.a.3': 'Your data is kept for 3 years after you log out; if you log back in within 3 years, the retention period restarts from the date of your new login. Accounts not logged into for more than 3 years will have their data permanently deleted.',
    'faq.q.4': 'Can an account be recovered after deletion?',
    'faq.a.4': 'Yes. After you apply to delete your account there is a 30-day grace period, during which logging back in restores the account; after the grace period expires, all associated data is permanently erased and cannot be recovered.',
    'faq.q.5': 'Does the platform sell my personal data?',
    'faq.a.5': 'Never. Your data is only shared to the extent necessary to provide the service (such as cloud providers and payment gateways); see the Privacy Policy for details.',
    'faq.q.6': 'I forgot my password. How do I recover a hacked account?',
    'faq.a.6': 'You can reset a forgotten password on the login page via your registered email. If you suspect your account has been hacked, contact an admin through the official Discord community as soon as possible, or submit a ticket (Account issues → Account hacked); we will handle it with priority. Please keep access to your registered email — account recovery must be verified through it.',
    'faq.q.7': 'How do I export my data?',
    'faq.a.7': 'You can request an export of your personal data and creative content (flags, articles, worldview settings, etc.) by submitting a "Privacy request" ticket; requests are handled by staff, and we will contact you within the first-human-reply target window to arrange the export.',
    'faq.q.8': 'Can minors register?',
    'faq.a.8': 'The platform does not serve children under 13; minors using the platform must follow the minor-protection provisions in clause 2 of the Terms of Service.',
    'faq.q.9': 'How will I be notified in the event of a data security incident?',
    'faq.a.9': 'If a data security incident that may affect your rights occurs, we will announce the overview of the incident, its possible impact and the countermeasures within a reasonable time through in-platform announcements, the Discord community and other channels, and report to regulators as required by law (see the Privacy Policy for details).',
    'faq.cat.billing': 'Subscription & Payment',
    'faq.q.10': 'What subscription plans are available and how much do they cost?',
    'faq.a.10': 'The platform offers multiple subscription tiers (including the flagship Premium Ultra). All subscribers can use basic AI features such as AI search, AI article polishing and AI summaries; advanced features such as automated AI suggestions are exclusive to Premium Ultra. Prices and the full benefits list for each tier will be announced when the subscription system launches.',
    'faq.q.11': 'Which payment methods are supported?',
    'faq.a.11': 'Stripe online payment is supported (bank cards / Apple Pay / Google Pay; GrabPay is supported locally in Malaysia). Sensitive details such as card numbers are handled directly by the payment gateway — the platform never stores your payment credentials.',
    'faq.q.12': 'Do subscriptions auto-renew?',
    'faq.a.12': 'Yes. Unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the end of the current billing period, the system will automatically charge and renew your subscription when it expires.',
    'faq.q.13': 'Can I request a refund?',
    'faq.a.13': 'Digital services are non-refundable in principle; if the platform service is continuously interrupted for more than 48 hours, you may contact an admin to request a pro-rata compensation.',
    'faq.q.14': 'Which currencies can I pay in?',
    'faq.a.14': 'Supported currencies are determined by the payment gateway (Stripe) and your card issuer; the amount and exchange rate shown on the payment gateway page apply at checkout. GrabPay e-wallet is recommended for local payment in Malaysia; bank cards (Apple / Google Pay supported) work in other regions.',
    'faq.cat.editor': 'Editor & Creation',
    'faq.q.15': 'Does text automatically wrap around cards?',
    'faq.a.15': 'Text wraps around a card only when the grid cell containing the text is actually occupied by the card; a card that merely shares a row with text or sits near it does not affect the text position.',
    'faq.q.16': 'Who owns my creative content?',
    'faq.a.16': 'You own it completely. The intellectual property of your original settings, worldview data, flags and assets belongs to you; the platform only uses them to the extent necessary for display, transmission and backup.',
    'faq.cat.ai': 'AI Features',
    'faq.q.17': 'Does the AI use my content to train models?',
