    'faq.q.22': 'How do I report rule-breaking content or plagiarism?',
    'faq.a.22': 'To report rule-breaking content or plagiarism, use the platform\'s dedicated reporting entry: click the "Report" button next to the relevant content to enter the reporting flow (including "Rule-breaking content report" and "Intellectual property complaint"); reports do not go through the ticket system. The platform will review and act within a reasonable time (see clause 5 of the Community Rules).',
    'faq.q.23': 'I received a private message from someone claiming to be official staff. How do I verify them?',
    'faq.a.23': 'Platform support will not normally message you first; in special cases (such as account security checks or handling order issues) the operations team will proactively contact you under the official name, and will first present an official verification code (valid for 12 hours). You can enter the code in the "Verify official staff identity" section below on this page to verify: after it passes, the page shows when the code was created, the staff member\'s alias (official staff do not use real names), their role and responsibilities. Official staff will never ask for your password, SMS code or payment details under any circumstances; any "official private message" that does not show a code, shows an invalid code, or asks for such information is an impersonator — do not respond, and check or report it in the official Discord community.',
    'faq.empty': 'No matching questions found',
    'sec.contact.title': 'Contact Us',
    'contact.discord.title': 'Official Community Server',
    'contact.discord.body': 'If you have any questions, contact an admin directly in the official Slati Studio Discord community server (Slati Studio team).',
    'contact.discord.btn': 'Join the server',
    'contact.email.title': 'Official Email',
    'contact.email.body': 'The official contact email will be added here once the platform\'s official domain is confirmed.',
    'contact.ai.title': 'AI Support',
    'contact.ai.body': 'A 24/7 AI support powered by Gemini / DeepSeek, instantly answering common questions that do not require special permissions; for matters requiring special permissions (account data, orders, appeals, etc.), the AI will guide you to the <a href="ticket.html" style="color:var(--color-primary)">ticket page</a> to submit a staff ticket. Replies are for reference only; important matters are handled by staff.',
    'contact.ai.btn': 'Open AI support',
    'contact.ticket.title': 'Staff Tickets',
    'contact.ticket.body': 'For matters requiring staff handling (payment and billing, creator settlement, account and penalty appeals, privacy requests, etc.), submit a ticket and wait in the queue; urgent matters (such as account security or payment anomalies) are handled first. The target for the first human reply is within 3 days.',
    'contact.ticket.btn': 'Submit a ticket',
    'fraud': '⚠️ Anti-fraud notice: platform support will not normally message you first; in special cases (such as account security checks or handling order issues) the operations team will proactively contact you under the official name, and will first present an official verification code (valid for 12 hours) to prove their identity — you can enter the code in the "Verify official staff identity" section on this page to verify, and the result shows when the code was created, plus the staff member\'s alias, role and responsibilities. Official staff will never ask for your password, SMS code or payment details under any circumstances; any "official private message" that does not show a code, shows an invalid code, or asks for such information is an impersonator — do not respond, and check or report it in the official Discord community.',
    'sec.verify.title': 'Verify official staff identity',
    'sec.legal.title': 'Legal Documents',
